1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,425
Kalau Prabowo tidak menang di Pilpres 2024,

2
00:00:03,475 --> 00:00:04,938
apa yang berubah di Indonesia?

3
00:00:05,238 --> 00:00:06,511
Faktanya, KPU menetapkan

4
00:00:06,511 --> 00:00:08,314
Prabowo–Gibran menang satu putaran

5
00:00:08,314 --> 00:00:10,799
dengan 58,6 persen suara sah.

6
00:00:10,999 --> 00:00:12,977
Dalam skenario lain, presidennya bisa

7
00:00:12,977 --> 00:00:14,795
Anies–Muhaimin atau Ganjar–Mahfud,

8
00:00:14,795 --> 00:00:16,200
mungkin lewat putaran kedua.

9
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:17,485
Pertama, anggaran.

10
00:00:17,585 --> 00:00:19,349
Prabowo–Gibran mengusung makan siang

11
00:00:19,349 --> 00:00:20,133
dan susu gratis.

12
00:00:20,183 --> 00:00:22,285
Anies–Muhaimin menonjolkan perumahan rakyat.

13
00:00:22,335 --> 00:00:23,786
Ganjar–Mahfud: KTP Sakti

14
00:00:23,786 --> 00:00:26,143
dan satu desa, satu faskes, satu nakes.

15
00:00:26,193 --> 00:00:27,876
Porsi anggaran berpotensi bergeser.

16
00:00:28,176 --> 00:00:30,173
Kedua, koalisi. Tak satu kubu pun

17
00:00:30,173 --> 00:00:31,716
menguasai mayoritas DPR.

18
00:00:31,766 --> 00:00:34,030
Pemenang mana pun perlu merangkul partai lain.

19
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:36,109
Ketiga, kecepatan. Prabowo–Gibran

20
00:00:36,109 --> 00:00:38,265
berjanji melanjutkan Ibu Kota Nusantara;

21
00:00:38,265 --> 00:00:39,771
Ganjar–Mahfud secara bertahap;

22
00:00:39,771 --> 00:00:41,980
Anies–Muhaimin mendahulukan kebutuhan dasar.

23
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:44,107
Tapi presiden tidak bekerja sendiri.

24
00:00:44,207 --> 00:00:46,726
Undang-undang dan APBN dibahas bersama DPR,

25
00:00:46,726 --> 00:00:48,460
birokrasi menjalankan, dan kondisi

26
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:50,092
ekonomi membatasi ruang belanja.

27
00:00:50,492 --> 00:00:52,466
Jadi, arah prioritas mungkin berubah,

28
00:00:52,466 --> 00:00:54,660
tetapi hasilnya bergantung pada pelaksanaan.

29
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:56,076
Menurutmu, kebijakan apa

30
00:00:56,076 --> 00:00:57,320
yang paling mungkin berbeda?

